@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Experimental Nordic SoftDevice notification completion callback
+
+This branch derives from TinyGo Bluetooth v0.13.0 and adds:
+
+    Adapter.SetNotificationCompleteHandler(func(count uint16))
+
+For SoftDevice S113/S132/S140 it forwards BLE_GATTS_EVT_HVN_TX_COMPLETE
+(count of completed notifications). The callback is executed by the BLE
+event dispatcher: do not block, allocate, print, or send Bluetooth data there.
+It is intentionally separate from a consumer application's flow-control policy.
+
+Experimental API; test on hardware before requesting upstream integration.
+TinyGo Bluetooth license and copyright remain unchanged.
diff --git a/adapter_nrf528xx-full.go b/adapter_nrf528xx-full.go
